Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-09-2001||12:26 AM||||Sorry everyone.. I was at a Clip Art site & everytime you click on anything, A new one pops up.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P><FONT SIZE="1">If you ate pasta and antipasta, would you still be hungry?<P>If the pen is mightier than the sword, and a picture is worth<BR>a thousand words, how dangerous is a fax?<P>Always remember that you're unique, just like everyone else.<P>Energizer Bunny arrested, charged with battery.<P>If the #2 pencil is the most popular, why is it still #2?<P>Bumper Sticker- Laugh alone and the world thinks you're an idiot.<P>What happens if you get scared half to death twice?<P>Beauty is only skin deep...but ugly goes all the way to the bone!<P>Early bird gets the worm, but the second mouse gets the cheese<P>Bumper Sticker- We have enough youth, how about a fountain of Smart?<P>Everyone has a photographic memory. Some just don't have film.<P>Ever notice how fast Windows runs? Neither did I...<P>I have a map of the United States, life size. 1 mile equals<BR>1 mile. It's a *****  to fold it.<P>Bumper Sticker- Warning: Dates in Calendar are closer than they appear.<P></FONT><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 11-09-2001).]||||reg||11
