Z||000003||WhiteFieroBlur||11-09-2001||01:32 AM||||- Why doesn't glue stick to the inside of the bottle? <P>- Why is it called lipstick if you can still move your lips? <P>- Why is it that rain drops but snow falls? <P>- Why isn't there mouse-flavored cat food? <P>- Why don't you ever see the headline "Psychic Wins Lottery"? <P>- When cheese gets it's picture taken, what does it say? <P>- If the cops arrest a mime, do they tell hiim he has the right to remain silent? <P>- Why do they sterilize the needles for lethal injections? <P>- When companies ship Styrofoam, what do they pack it in?||||reg||1
