Z||000005||Pontiaddict||11-09-2001||02:10 AM||||comments made in red<P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Sorry everyone.. I was at a Clip Art site & everytime you click on anything, A new one pops up.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P><FONT SIZE="1">If you ate pasta and antipasta, would you still be hungry?<BR><FONT COLOR="red">Isn't it antipasto?</FONT><BR>If the pen is mightier than the sword, and a picture is worth<BR>a thousand words, how dangerous is a fax?<BR><FONT COLOR="red">Pretty dangerous, you can get a nasty papercut.</FONT><BR>Always remember that you're unique, just like everyone else.<P>Energizer Bunny arrested, charged with battery.<BR><FONT COLOR="red">I heard he resisted arrest, when they tried to stop him, he kept going and going and going...</FONT><BR>If the #2 pencil is the most popular, why is it still #2?<P>Bumper Sticker- Laugh alone and the world thinks you're an idiot.<P>What happens if you get scared half to death twice?<BR><FONT COLOR="red">You'd have 1/4 of the life you had to begin with becuase you were only scared half of the half that you had left. It explains desensitisation pretty well too.</FONT><BR>Beauty is only skin deep...but ugly goes all the way to the bone!<P>Early bird gets the worm, but the second mouse gets the cheese<P>Bumper Sticker- We have enough youth, how about a fountain of Smart?<P>Everyone has a photographic memory. Some just don't have film.<FONT COLOR="red">Mines more like a cheap digital camera with low batteries.</FONT><P>Ever notice how fast Windows runs? Neither did I...<P>I have a map of the United States, life size. 1 mile equals<BR>1 mile. It's a *****  to fold it.<P>Bumper Sticker- Warning: Dates in Calendar are closer than they appear.<P></FONT><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
